            "title": "Step 1. Order Has Been Processed",
            "title2": "",
            "show_contact": false,
            "text": "",
            "richtext": "<p>The processing time is indicated on each product page. Transit time is additional. So, the total time to receive your order = processing time + transportation time.</p><p>For additional reference on where your items will come from:</p><ul><li>French Fitness Equipment: 100% from Benicia, CA warehouse</li><li>Brand New Equipment (non French Fitness brand): 15% shop from Benicia, CA while the rest will be coming from other States.</li><li>Remanufactured Equipment: 80% are from Benicia, CA. 20% from other states</li></ul><p><a href=\"#shopify-section-template--26646844801340__faq_333TMG\" title=\"See shipping options\">See shipping options</a></p>",
            "list_items": "",
            "link": "",
