          "settings": {
            "heading": "Curbside Delivery",
            "heading_size": "tiny",
            "text_transform": false,
            "mobile_title_size": "normal"
          }
        },
        "text_TKxCiw": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Get your machines delivered to the closest curb accessible by a 24-foot box truck.</p><p>What to expect:</p><ul><li>Shipping time: 2-14 business days (lower 48 states). Call or email us to confirm your arrival date.</li><li>Delivered by one person via third-party courier</li><li>Machines are packed in a crate</li><li>Customer is responsible for moving, unpacking, and disposing of packaging</li><li>Assembly varies by product. See the product page for details.</li><li>For addresses without curbs, refer to the image below for possible delivery locations.</li></ul>",
