    "shipping_service_regions_fIgMa9": {
      "type": "shipping-service-regions",
      "blocks": {
        "region_usa": {
          "type": "region",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Continental USA",
            "text": "<p>Continental USA is our standard shipping and service market. Most orders ship through the website without special handling. Freight, white-glove delivery, and assembly options are available at checkout where applicable.</p>"
          }
        },
        "region_hawaii": {
          "type": "region",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Hawaii and Alaska",
            "text": "<p>We ship to Hawaii and Alaska, and website shipping quotes work for most customers in major population areas. Very remote areas may require a special freight quote. If you are concerned your ZIP code may be remote or may require special handling, you can contact us before ordering to confirm. If the actual freight cost is significantly higher than the website quote, Fitness Superstore may contact you after the order with options: pay the shipping difference, arrange your own freight, or cancel for a full refund.</p>"
          }
        },
        "region_pr": {
          "type": "region",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Puerto Rico",
            "text": "<p>We ship to Puerto Rico, and website shipping quotes work for most customers in standard service areas. Very remote or unusually expensive destinations may require a special freight quote. If you are concerned your address may require special handling, you can contact us before ordering to confirm. If the actual freight cost is significantly higher than the website quote, Fitness Superstore may contact you after the order with options: pay the shipping difference, arrange your own freight, or cancel for a full refund.</p>"
          }
        },
        "region_caribbean": {
          "type": "region",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Caribbean and Other Island Destinations",
            "text": "<p>Shipping may be available to select Caribbean and other island destinations. Freight, customs, delivery, and service options may vary by destination. Customers can order online when website shipping terms are available, but if a destination requires special handling or a non-standard freight arrangement, our team may contact the customer after order placement with available options.</p>"
          }
        },
        "region_canada": {
          "type": "region",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Canada",
            "text": "<p>We ship to Canada, and website shipping quotes work for most customers in major population areas. Remote regions may require special quoting or may have limited delivery or service options. If you are concerned your postal code may be remote, you can contact us before ordering to confirm. If actual freight or service logistics are materially different from the website quote, Fitness Superstore may contact you after the order with available options.</p>"
          }
        },
        "region_intl": {
          "type": "region",
          "settings": {
            "title": "International (outside USA and Canada)",
            "text": "<p>International shipping is available through the website under the standard international door-to-port (CIF) shipping terms shown on the site. Customers do not need to contact us before ordering unless they want shipping terms other than the standard website terms. If you need different freight terms, special delivery handling, or clarification before ordering, contact our team.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "region_usa",
        "region_hawaii",
        "region_pr",
        "region_caribbean",
        "region_canada",
        "region_intl"
      ],
